    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604850/extras/66fb578be207115135720c5b4b8b8457.poster.avif?t=1729791195\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604850/extras/66fb578be207115135720c5b4b8b8457.webm?t=1729791195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604850/extras/66fb578be207115135720c5b4b8b8457.mp4?t=1729791195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Resource management:</strong> Construct essential buildings to gather key resources like food, wood, and metal, crucial for city survival and expansion.<br></li><li> <strong>Strategic defense:</strong> Use those resources to build defenses such as watchtowers, radar stations, and barricades to protect your city against threats.<br></li><li> <strong>Army recruitment:</strong> Allocate resources wisely to recruit and train a diverse army, from infantry to specialized units.<br></li><li> <strong>Dynamic construction:</strong> Adapt and evolve your city's infrastructure to meet the changing needs and challenges in a hostile post-apocalyptic environment.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604850/extras/946bdbff64efdb65755f65835edd349b.poster.avif?t=1729791195\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604850/extras/946bdbff64efdb65755f65835edd349b.webm?t=1729791195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604850/extras/946bdbff64efdb65755f65835edd349b.mp4?t=1729791195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>In the middle of the action:</strong> As the architect, be at the heart of the action. Directly control your character to run between buildings, command your army, and confront enemies head-on, offering a unique blend of strategy and action.<br></li><li> <strong>Tactical combat system:</strong> Master a complex defense system where each choice counters specific enemy threats, crucial for survival.<br></li><li> <strong>Progressive night:</strong> Defend against intensifying attacks each night, with the difficulty escalating until you triumphantly clear the level.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604850/extras/57f7007963131f97042491c4d8d5bd3c.poster.avif?t=1729791195\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604850/extras/57f7007963131f97042491c4d8d5bd3c.webm?t=1729791195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604850/extras/57f7007963131f97042491c4d8d5bd3c.mp4?t=1729791195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Expansive upgrade tree:</strong> Dive into a comprehensive upgrade system, featuring new building types and numerous enhancements for your existing structures.<br></li><li> <strong>Interactive overworld:</strong> Navigate an overworld teeming with levels, secrets, and characters, each offering unique interactions and contributing to the overarching narrative.</li></ul>",
